===Etymology===
From {{etyl|tn}} {{term|tsetse|lang=tn}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|pl2=tsetse}}

# Any [[fly]] of the [[genus]] ''[[Glossina]]'', native to [[Africa]], that feeds on human and animal blood; known primarily as a carrier of parasitic [[trypanosome]]s.

